            "text": "Cobb, for her part, started to ask conference organizers who invited her to speak whether/if she could do so remotely; about three-quarters of the time, they agreed. When the answer was no, she declined the invitation. That approach brought Cobb’s air travel last year down by 75%, and she plans to continue the practice. “It has been fairly rewarding.” she says, “a really positive change.”"
